 "doc": "docs/provenance.md §Tip continuity. The ONE table both tools/provenance (gitstore.continuity_verdict) and tools/reeve (provenance-foreign-tip) must agree on, row for row. Shas are synthetic 40-hex spellings of a short tag. Every mark carries 'created' (the artifact's created_at as a UTC epoch — marks order by (created, seq), upload time first) and 'seq' (the artifact id). 'parents' answers first_parent AND, by a first-parent walk, is_ancestor (the evidence ref is linear). 'chain' is the accepted (ok) or partially walked (foreign) intent chain; 'conflicts' (default []) the verified evidence checkpoints the newest one does not descend from.",
